93,0$Pileus 10-60 mm in diameter, watery brown, brownish orange, grayish orange, paler and more pink toned when expanded, grayish red, pale red, grayish orange, pale orange, or pinkish white, old specimens dingy buff, light orange or yellow; spores 4-6 x 2.5- 3.5(-4) ?m$C. americana (pg. 249)
