104,0$Pileus subhemispherical to applanate, disc sometimes shallowly depressed; lamellae crowded to close, gray, brownish gray, or brownish orange, fading to grayish orange, orangish gray, or yellowish white; stipe fading to off-white; odor absent or fungoid; taste mild or fungoid$C. pseudodicolor (pg. 149)
